  "descriptionHtml": "<p>We found a friendly kind of snake. Our Ivy crossbody is crafted from snake-embossed leather with a snap closure and an exterior slip pocket for the things you reach for first. A chain strap option lets you dress it up for dinner. An adjustable leather strap takes it everywhere else.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Snake embossed leather</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Silver hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable and removeable crossbody strap with 22&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Snap closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 9.6&quot; (L) x 5.1&quot; (H) x 2.00&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
